cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "otwin-hybrid: a hybrid digital twin for Li-ion battery state of health"
abstract: "The worked example the Otwin project grew from: forecasting Li-ion state of health from the first 40% of a cell's life, comparing a physics power law, a Gaussian process and a physics-plus-residual hybrid under a temporal split with mandatory baselines. Reproduced in Python, Julia and R."
